ts` in `ledger/currency.py` used `int(amount * 100)`, which truncates. Floats like `19.99` become `1998.9999\u2026` and came out as 1998 cents instead of 1999. The other two failures came from the same error: `0.29 \u00d7 3` gave 84 instead of 87, and the discount total gave 781 instead of 783.\n\n**Fix:** `to_cents` now converts through `Decimal(str(amount))` and rounds half up to whole cents.\n\n**Limitation:** `Decimal(str(amount))` uses the float's shortest decimal repr, so a float with more than two decimals (say `0.125`) rounds half up to the nearest cent rather than raising an error.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 0, "replies_ok": 7, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 120370, "requests_cache_write": 22463, "requests_cost_usd": 0.0865065, "requests_count": 7, "requests_input_uncached": 16, "requests_output": 1828, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-multistep:claude-opus-5-5:trial11", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 20, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-17T23:14:23.129237+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 17.942, "t_checker_s": 0.549, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-multistep", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1844, "tokens_cache_read": 120370, "tokens_cache_write": 22463, "tokens_fresh": 1844, "tokens_input_uncached": 16, "tokens_main_cache_read": 120370, "tokens_main_cache_write": 22463, "tokens_main_calls": 7, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 16, "tokens_main_output": 1828, "tokens_output": 1828, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 120370, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 22463, "tok